{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01QgHA5XTn4LtEfDCVM86jwL", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08607\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/252/sensors/node41.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://telecomtrainer.com/sdqnr-signal-to-distortion-quantization-noise-ratio\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.vintagedigital.com.au/glossary/signal-to-noise-ratio/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/?p=4020\"}, {\"url\": \"https://telecomtrainer.com/snr-signal-to-noise-ratio\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.vintagedigital.com.au/?p=194600\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:49:13.905Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "信号量化噪声比 SQNR 单位 分贝", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01DJyTabTHD4Q191GPxqKykL", "content": [{"title": "A Quantization-Friendly Separable Convolution for MobileNets", "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08607"}, {"title": "Because the ADC outputs only levels there is inherently noise in the quantized", "url": "https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/252/sensors/node41.html"}, {"title": "signal to quantization noise ratio (SQNR)", "url": "https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html"}, {"title": "SDQNR Signal to Distortion Quantization Noise Ratio", "url": "https://telecomtrainer.com/sdqnr-signal-to-distortion-quantization-noise-ratio"}, {"title": "Signal-to-Noise Ratio", "url": "https://www.vintagedigital.com.au/glossary/signal-to-noise-ratio/"}, {"title": "Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR)", "url": "https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/?p=4020"}, {"title": "SNR (signal to noise ratio)", "url": "https://telecomtrainer.com/snr-signal-to-noise-ratio"}, {"title": "Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR)", "url": "https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/"}, {"title": "Signal-to-Noise Ratio", "url": "https://www.vintagedigital.com.au/?p=194600"}]}, "SQNR 的单位是分贝（dB），它是信号功率与量化噪声功率之比取对数的结果。\n\n- 定义：一篇 arXiv 论文把 SQNR 定义为未量化信号功率与量化误差功率之比，并给出 10·log10 的分贝公式（SQNR = 10 · log10(E(x²)/E(n²)) in dB）。\n- 与位数的关系：在 A/D 转换语境中，常用的经验值是每个量化位约对应 6 dB。SQNR in dB is approximately equal to 6 times the number of bits of the ADC，因此 16 位约为 96 dB。\n- 另一种写法：有些资料把 SQNR 描述为信号电压与噪声电压之比，同样以分贝表示（It is defined as the ratio of the signal voltage to the noise voltage and is specified in decibels (dB).）。这种电压比的分贝公式使用 20·log10，而功率比使用 10·log10，两者是同一概念在不同量上的表达。\n\n注意：搜索结果中的公式以功率比（10·log10）为主，电压比则用 20·log10。引用时应确认采用的是功率还是电压。"], "durationSeconds": 5.429357875000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01QgHA5XTn4LtEfDCVM86jwL", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDWukTskbm3MDgS8ehGy", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：分贝（dB）。**\n\nSQNR 是信号功率与量化噪声功率之比取对数，所以用 dB 表示。按功率比算是 10·log10(信号功率/噪声功率)。按电压比算则用 20·log10。\n\n在 A/D 转换里，经验值是每增加 1 个量化位，SQNR 约增加 6 dB。例如 16 位约为 96 dB。\n\n我只搜了 1 次。上面的公式和经验值来自搜索结果的摘要，我没有打开原页面核对。\n\nSources:\n- [A Quantization-Friendly Separable Convolution for MobileNets](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08607)\n- [Because the ADC outputs only levels there is inherently noise in the quantized (CCRMA, Stanford)](https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/252/sensors/node41.html)\n- [signal to quantization noise ratio (SQNR) – itwissen.info](https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html)\n- [Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR) – Vibration Research](https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1117, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4302, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1117}, "output_tokens": 447, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:49:19.314Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDWukCFzY5wQUMwFqGZV"}
